  "bodyText": "THE ONLINE MARKETPLACE OF IDEAS\n\nCLEAR\nDARK\nARCHIVE\nNEW 📡\n\nNewest from NM\n\nNM Talkcore: artist Steven Warwick on making music in a time of content\n\nNM Greenroom: VICE magazine's Ben Ditto & Kevin Lee Kharas\n\nNM Content Today: Quis Contra Nos, Venetia?\n\nVIEW MORE\n10+\nRADIO PLAYS & MIXTAPES BY @LILINTERNET\n\nIllegal Generation Vol. 2 by Lil Internet (2025)\n\nIllegal Generation Vol. 1 by the Bootcut Boys (2024)\n\nElon Musk: 2040 / 69 (2023)\n\nVIEW MORE\n6+\nNM TV\n\nNM-produced video content\n\nKevin Munger on Vilém Flusser's Communicology: Mutations in Human Relations?\n\nExocapitalism: \"Lift\" | Marek Poliks + Roberto Alonso Trillo | Live @ Trust, Berlin (Oct 2025)\n\nWelcome to the NM WebDex – Will Freudenheim & @phm\n\nVIEW MORE\n2+\nNM READS\n\nTexts read aloud (w/ prod. by Lil Internet)\n\nNM Reads: Neo-orality (Jacqueline Fendt) Pt. 1\n\nNM Reads: Gavin Brown, Caroline Busta, Joshua Citarella, Ben Davis, Jason Farago, Tobias Spichtig, Lloyd Wise read excerpts from What Is Contemporary Art For Today? (Perić, 2025) w/ Seaport Talk's Mat Moravec, Eleonore Hugendubel, Dean Kissick\n\nNM Reads: excerpts from Charles Stross's Accelerando\n\nVIEW MORE\n3+\nNM LIVE\n\nAudio from public events & conversations, edited for the at-home listener\n\nNM Live: Caroline Busta x Jak Ritger on Loretta Fahrenholz @ Amant, NYC (2025)\n\nNM Live: Transmit the Future (w/ Carly & Lil Internet) - Vienna Digital Cultures (2025)\n\nNM LECTURES\n\nSelected live talks\n\nLil Internet Lecture: :::Feel the Future::: - Vienna Digital Cultures, 2025\n\nNM Lecture: Understanding Predicting Media (on Holographic Media) – Global Art Forum, Dubai, 2023\n\nNM Lecture: Do You Know Where You Live? (on Non-linear Media) – \"Future of Criticism\", Bundeskunsthalle Bonn, 2022\n\nVIEW MORE\n1+\nRESIDENCY: NM X HEAVY TRAFFIC\n\nEssays from Heavy Traffic magazine read aloud by their authors\n\nNM x Heavy Traffic: Mark Leckey, “Enter Through Medieval Wounds”\n\nNM x Heavy Traffic: Olivia Kan-Sperling, “The Perfect Glove”\n\nNM x Heavy Traffic: Keller Easterling, “NON_2”\n\nVIEW MORE\n2+\nTHE NEW MODELS PODCAST\n\nFull-length interviews with artists, scholars, and other experts\n\nNM93: Daniël de Zeeuw & Sal Hagen on the post-discursive web\n\nNM92: Scholar Peli Griezter updates his 2017 \"Theory of Vibe\"\n\nNM91: Daniel Felstead & Jenn Leung on Jankspace\n\nVIEW MORE\n93+\nNM CONTENT TODAY\n\nTopics that need no further coverage\n\nNM Content Today: Quo Vadis Looksmaxxer?\n\nNM Content Today: Quis Contra Nos, Venetia?\n\nNM GREENROOM\n\nNM speaks with artists about new & forthcoming work\n\nNM Greenroom: VICE mag's Ben Ditto & Kevin Lee Kharas -\n\nNM Greenroom: Calla Henkel & Max Pitegoff on New Theater Hollywood\n\nNM Greenroom: Olivia Kan-Sperling on Little Pink Book (2025)\n\nVIEW MORE\n11+\nNM TALKCORE\n\nFreeform chat with friends of the pod\n\nNM Talkcore: Steven Warwick on making music in a time of \"content\"\n\nNM Talkcore: Jay Springett on Slop Machines of Loving Grace\n\nNM Talkcore: political scientist Kevin Munger on spiraling (2025)\n\nVIEW MORE\n6+\nNM DISPATCH\nReflections on the everyday\n\nNM Dispatch: America Diaries | Aug 2025 — Lil Internet\n\nNM Dispatch: Hallucinator's Dice | Mar 2025 – Lil Internet\n\nNM Dispatch: The Jacket | Sep 2024 – Lil Internet\n\nVIEW MORE\n10+\nNM TEXT / EDITORIAL\n\nHELLO DARKNESS – Dean Kissick (2021)\n\nASTROTURFS OF OFFENSE – Agency of Shifting Uncertain Situations (2020)\n\nNM SIMSOCIETY – Cade Diehm & Joshua Citarella (2020)\n\nVIEW MORE\n11+\nNM SPECIAL REPORTS\n\nOn-the-ground, first-person reports & responses to recent events\n\nNM Special Report: Trevor McFedries on Market Imaginaries\n\nNM Special Report: The Future of Content w/ Jak Ritger\n\nNM Special Report: Ye and the Future of Content w/ Dean Kissick\n\nVIEW MORE\n17+\nNM SHORTS\n\nNew models detected and unpacked in 30-min or less\n\nNM Short: Lil Internet's VICE Interrupted (2024)\n\nNM Short: Carly & Lil Internet on Jordan Wolfson’s “Body Sculpture” (2024)\n\nNM Short: Out of the MUD by Lil Internet (2023)\n\nVIEW MORE\n3+\nSUBSCRIBE\n\nUnlock 200+ episodes & join the NM Discord\n\nSubstack €5\nPatreon €5\nPatreon + Discord €8\nChannel web3\n\nLISTEN TO MORE PUBLIC EPISODES ...\nApple\nSpotify\nYouTube\nSoundcloud\n\nNM SHOP\n\nNM ADJACENT CHANNELS\nJoshua Citarella & Doomscroll [YT] [Substack]\nDo Not Research [blog] [Substack]\nHolly Herndon & Mat Dryhurst [studio]\nKevin Munger [site] [Substack]\nMarek Poliks [Disintegrator pod]\nJay Springett [site]\nTrust [site]\n\nNM RECOMMENDS\n\nRecent books by NM guests\n\nOlivia Kan-Sperling, Little Pink Book: A Bad, Bad Novel (2025, Archway)\n\nMarek Poliks & Roberto Alonso Trillo, Exocapitalism (2025, Becoming)\n\nHolly Herndon & Mat Dryhurst, All Media is Training Data (2024, Serpentine & König)\n\nKevin Munger, The YouTube Apparatus (2024, Cambridge)\n\nHari Kunzru, Blue Ruin (2024, Knopf)\n\nCalla Henkel, Scrap (2024, Sceptre)\n\nNatasha Stagg, Artless (2024, MIT)\n\nOrit Halpern & Robert Mitchell, The Smartness Mandate (2023, MIT)\n\nEmmelyn Butterfield-Rosen, Modern Art and the Remaking of Human Disposition (2021, Chicago)\n\nKevin Driscoll, The Modem World (2022, Yale)\n\nSam Moore, Alex Roberts, The Rise of Ecofascism (2022, Polity)\n\nS. Basar, D. Coupland, HUO, The Extreme Self (2021, Penguin)\n\nNM PROJECTS\n\nNM COLLABS & COMMUNITY OUTPUT\n\nNM Y2K20 CODEX 📒 – led by @leith, @mgr, @phm, @orfhtiff, @sah_raw, @_will, @ja_ak_rtgr, @h̷a̷y̷w̷i̷r̷e̷z̶,\n\nNM Y2K20 WEBDEX – @phm, @_will, @bradley, @dan, @davidy, @gristleism, @ja_ak_rtgr, @jakuby, @jord0, @leïth, @localhost96, @mgr, @eclectictasteofbot & general NM Community\n\nDECADE BRAIN – NM x Bjarne Melgaard (2020)\n\nVIEW MORE\n4+\nNEWSSTAND\n\nAAAAARG\nAFFIDAVIT\nAFRICA IS A COUNTRY\nART AGAINST ART\nARTFORUM\nART NEWS\nARTNET\nBAFFLER\nBIDOUN\nBOMB\nBRAND-NEW-LIFE\nBROOKLYN RAIL\nCAPSULE\nCIVILIZATION\nCREATIVE INDEPENDENT\nCOMMUNE\nCONTEMPORARY ART DAILY\nCONTEMPORARY ART WRITING DAILY\nDIS.ART\nDOCUMENT\nDRUDGE REPORT\nECONOMIST\nE-FLUX\nDISSENT\nFAST COMPANY\nFILM COMMENT\nFINANCIAL TIMES\nFAILED ARCHITECTURE\nFLASH ART\nFRIEZE\nGALAXIA Y2K\nGREY ROOM\nHACKER NEWS\nHARPER'S\nHIGHSNOBIETY\ni-D\nINTERVIEW\nJACOBITE\nKALEIDOSCOPE\nLA REVIEW of BOOKS\nLIBRARY STACK\nLOGIC\nLONDON REVIEW of BOOKS\nMAY REVUE\nMYTH\nNEO-METABOLISM\nN+1\nNEW INQUIRY\nNEW YORKER\nNY REVIEW of BOOKS\nNOĒMA\nNOVARA MEDIA\nNOVEMBRE\nOCTOBER\nPARIS REVIEW\nPIN-UP\nTHE POINT\nQUIETUS\nREAL LIFE\nREDDIT\nRHIZOME\nRIBBON FARM\nSELVA\nSMALL PRESS\nSPEX\nSPIKE\nSTARSHIP\nSTRELKA MAGAZINE\nTANK\nTEXTE ZUR KUNST\nTOPICAL CREAM\nTRIPLE CANOPY\nUBU WEB\nVESTOJ\nVIEWPOINT\nX-TRA\n032C\n\nAPPLE\nCHANNEL\nINSTAGRAM\nNM SHOP\nNM STUDIO\nPATREON\nSOUNDCLOUD\nSPOTIFY\nSUBSTACK\nX\nYOUTUBE\n© 2026 NEW MODELS",
